From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sliva0 <sliva0mk@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diameter: Add SN-Request-Type from 3GPP TS 29.219
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

3GPP TS 29.219 V19.0.0 defines this AVP in vendor 10415, which the
dictionary has no entry for at its code:

  SN-Request-Type (2907): Unsigned32, clause 5.3.7

Each entry's type, enumerated values and grouped members are the
document's, from its clauses and AVP tables, and so are its M and V bits
where the document states them.

Generated by Seanchaí (integrations/wireshark/additions.py).
---
 resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
index 56a8586..481784b 100644
--- a/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
+++ b/resources/protocols/diameter/dictionary.xml
@@ -7883,6 +7883,9 @@
 		<avp name="Pending-Policy-Counter-Change-Time" code="2906" mandatory="must" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<type type-name="Time"/>
 		</avp>
+		<avp name="SN-Request-Type" code="2907" mandatory="mustnot" vendor-bit="must" vendor-id="TGPP">
+			<type type-name="Unsigned32"/>
+		</avp>
 
 		<avp name="Device-Action" code="3001" mandatory="must" vendor-bit="must" protected="may" vendor-id="TGPP">
 			<grouped>
